  "solution": {
    "text": "Condition of translational equilibrium<br > <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">μ</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></math> <br > <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">μ</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></math> <br >Solving  <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">μ</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">μ</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></mrow></mfrac></math> <br > <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">μ</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">μ</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">μ</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></mrow></mfrac></math> <br >Applying torque equation about corner (left) point on the floor<br > <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">cos</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">θ</mi></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn>